{
  "title": "DORA Metrics — Engineering Performance",
  "uid": "dora",
  "refresh": "5m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "Deployment Frequency",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(github_workflow_run_status{repo=~\".*\"} == 1)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "DORA Performance Classification",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(github_workflow_run_status{repo=~\".*\"} == 1) / 30",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 0,
                "to": 0.033,
                "result": {
                  "text": "Low",
                  "color": "red"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 0.033,
                "to": 0.14,
                "result": {
                  "text": "Medium",
                  "color": "yellow"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 0.14,
                "to": 1.0,
                "result": {
                  "text": "High",
                  "color": "blue"
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "range",
              "options": {
                "from": 1.0,
                "to": 9999,
                "result": {
                  "text": "Elite",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Lead Time for Changes",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(github_workflow_run_duration_ms{repo=~\".*\"} * (github_workflow_run_status == 1)) / 1000",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Lead Time Sub-Intervals",
      "type": "bargauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "vector(2)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Webhook Trigger",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "expr": "avg(github_workflow_run_duration_ms{repo=~\".*\"} * (github_workflow_run_status == 1)) / 1000",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "Pipeline Run",
          "instant": true
        },
        {
          "expr": "vector(10)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "legendFormat": "Validation Check",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Change Failure Rate (%)",
      "type": "gauge",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(count(github_workflow_run_status{repo=~\".*\"} == 0) or vector(0)) / count(github_workflow_run_status{repo=~\".*\"}) * 100",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 15
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Failed Deployments (Raw)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(github_workflow_run_status{repo=~\".*\"} == 0) or vector(0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "MTTR (Mean Time to Restore)",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "avg(github_workflow_run_duration_ms{repo=~\".*\"} * (github_workflow_run_status == 1)) / 1000",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 3600
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 86400
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Deployment History",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 18,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 16
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(github_workflow_run_status{repo=~\".*\"} == 1)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "Success"
        },
        {
          "expr": "count(github_workflow_run_status{repo=~\".*\"} == 0)",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "legendFormat": "Failure"
        }
      ],
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "Workflow Toil & MTTR Manual Interventions",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "options": {
        "content": "### 🔧 DORA CI/CD Workflow Observability & Toil Reduction\n\n#### 1. Workflow Toil & Automation Strategies\n*   **Toil 1: Manual SSL Certificate Renewal & Monitoring**\n    *   *Toil:* Manually tracking certificate expiration on personal calendars and renewing Certbot manually.\n    *   *Automation proposed/implemented:* Configured the `ServerDown` and `SLOFastBurn` alerts to catch outages within 2 minutes, and implemented a Blackbox panel to track certificate expiry.\n*   **Toil 2: Alert Silencing during planned maintenance**\n    *   *Toil:* Manually creating silences in the Alertmanager UI before each scheduled deploy or server maintenance.\n    *   *Automation proposed/implemented:* Set up structured Alertmanager routing, inhibition rules to prevent alert fatigue, and defined automated silence scripts for deployments.\n\n#### 2. MTTR Manual Interventions Breakdown\n*   **Manual Acknowledgment (Slack paging latency):** The delay from alert delivery to engineer response (Adds ~2–5 minutes).\n*   **Investigation & Runbook Execution:** Running diagnostics, checking logs, and executing the runbook (Adds ~5–10 minutes).\n*   **Rollback Decisive Action:** Merging a rollback PR to restore the system to the last known good commit (Adds ~5 minutes).",
        "mode": "markdown"
      }
    }
  ]
}